ch is usually just wrong (although not terribly damaging).=A0 You probably =
mean {a} or, better, {onai}.=A0 But the point is that you don't get a choic=
e; you have to have an automatic procedure for putting something in, and (u=
nless the procedure is much more complicated) the same thing each time.



